    "description": "Natural Quartz & Rose Quartz Mineral Specimen Lot\nRaw Earth-Mined Crystals, Points & Rough Chunks\nTotal Weight: 6.4 lbs\nThis natural mineral collection features a diverse assortment of quartz specimens totaling approximately 6.4 pounds. Centered around a substantial raw rose quartz rough piece displaying delicate pink coloration and natural crystalline fracturing, the collection also includes an array of clear quartz points, clusters, and raw fragments. Valued by mineral collectors, lapidary crafters, and crystal enthusiasts, these pieces highlight the distinctive geometry and natural clarity characteristic of quartz minerals.\nProminent rough rose quartz specimen measuring approximately 4.5 inches across\nClear quartz crystal points with visible terminations and prismatic striations\nAssorted crystalline clusters, rough chunks, and smaller crystal shards\nTotal collection weight of 6.4 pounds\nAcrylic risers shown in photographs are for display and not included\nCondition:\nVery good overall condition with average wear. Specimens feature natural crystalline growth lines, rough cleavage faces, and internal inclusions typical of raw minerals. Minor surface abrasions and natural edge chipping consistent with unpolished stones.\nNOTE\n: Unless otherwise indicated, this is a\nUSED\n, donated item/lot. We take every effort to document the condition and visible cosmetic damages, though we are not subject matter experts and items may contain unseen flaws or imperfections, such as cracks, crazing, bowing or separation.\nIf you have any questions regarding an item,\nplease reach out to us before placing your bid\n. If applicable, any testing for power or functionality, servicing or cleaning will be mentioned within the listing. Please assume items are untested, unserviced and presented as pictured otherwise.\nJEWELRY\n: Gemstones have been tested with Presidium Gemstone Tester. Precious metals are tested with a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL. Testing results are included in our listings where applicable. Gold JSP solution & rare earth magnets may also be used in testing. Gemstones may be natural or lab created. We identify gemstones to the best of our ability and testing equipment, but\nwe cannot guarantee specific gemstones\nif they look or test similar to other stones. Sterling Silver items may have very slight or localized magnetic properties due to rhodium plating, non-silver components such as pins or springs in clasps, or dependent on the metal the silver was alloyed with. Watch condition and functionality will be documented when possible. Watches may otherwise not be running, have internal issues or need additional cleaning.\nPlease Note\n: Certain jewelry items and lots may experience tangling from the sorting and shipping process.\nAS-IS\n: Listings are sold\nAS-IS with no refunds for condition or functionality\n. This includes, but is not limited to all electronic listings, all card lots, all jewelry lots and grab bags.\nIf you have any questions regarding an item,\nplease reach out to us before placing your bid\n.\nCOMBINED SHIPPING\n: All Jewelry items can not be combined with other any other items, including other Jewelry items without contacting customer service before payment. We reserve the right to approve or deny combination of items for shipment at our discretion.",
